Copied rather than read out of ~/tutorials so the tests describe a fixed input: the tutorials
tree is a working copy somebody edits while doing an exercise, and a test whose subject can be
edited underneath it reports on whatever was last saved there. The two `build/` directories are
the output of `make build` in those exercises -- they are here because a tutorials
`sX-runtime.json` names its own p4info and bmv2 json, so a fixture without them is a fixture
whose entries cannot be checked against anything.

[Co-developed with claude code -- Adam]
